class_name Chimney
extends Marker3D
## Marks a Chimney: two facing walls along the Course, close enough together that the Runner
## reaches the other wall still rising, which it climbs by Wall-jumping back and forth. Its floor
## runs a little way in, then a Gap runs under it up to the face of a ledge too high to Mantle
## onto from the floor. Placed at the Chimney's near end, in the middle across, at floor height
## 0, running along -Z to the ledge. The walls, floor and ledge make the Chimney, not this
## marker.
